# E-Commerce Admin Dashboard Guide

An interactive, responsive reference guide and dashboard overview for managing a WordPress/WooCommerce e-commerce store, fulfillment, financials, and customer care.

## 🚀 Live Demo
Once hosted on GitHub Pages, team members and administrators can easily reference this live workflow guide from any device.

## 📁 Repository Structure
- `index.html` - The main interactive dashboard web page.
- `README.md` - Documentation and setup instructions.
